In the results: Enter plays the release here. Shift+Enter opens its page in the browser, Ctrl+Enter its download page, Ctrl+Shift+Enter the artist page.=U rezultatima: Enter svira izdanje ovdje. Shift+Enter otvara njegovu stranicu u pregledniku, Ctrl+Enter stranicu za preuzimanje, Ctrl+Shift+Enter stranicu izvođača.
F5 previous track, F6 play or pause, F7 next track, F8 stop. The media keys work too.=F5 prethodna pjesma, F6 sviraj ili pauza, F7 sljedeća pjesma, F8 stop. Rade i medijske tipke.
Left and right arrows rewind and fast forward 5 seconds, with Shift 30 seconds.=Strelice lijevo i desno premotavaju 5 sekundi, uz Shift 30 sekundi.
The title bar shows what is playing.=Naslovna traka pokazuje što svira.
Finds releases on Bandcamp by country and genre, filters them by name, plays them in Bandcamp's own embedded player and opens them on Bandcamp in your browser.=Traži izdanja na Bandcampu po državi i žanru, filtrira ih po imenu, svira ih u Bandcampovom ugrađenom playeru i otvara ih na Bandcampu u tvom pregledniku.
It uses only what Bandcamp allows: its Discover service and the embedded player. Nothing is downloaded by the program.=Koristi samo ono što Bandcamp dopušta: servis Discover i ugrađeni player. Program sam ništa ne preuzima.
Country list: GeoNames, CC BY 4.0. Browser engine: Microsoft Edge WebView2.=Popis država: GeoNames, CC BY 4.0. Preglednik: Microsoft Edge WebView2.
